<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>RFID attendance | DNSC Smart HRMS</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="../assets/demo.css"></head><body><div class="demo-layout"><aside class="demo-sidebar"><div class="demo-brand"><div class="demo-logo" aria-label="Blank school logo placeholder"></div><div>DNSC<small>SMART HRMS</small></div></div><button class="demo-button demo-menu" data-menu aria-expanded="false">Toggle menu</button><nav data-demo-sidebar="employee" aria-label="Section pages"></nav><p>Frontend demonstration<br>Sample data · Open access</p></aside><main class="demo-main"><header class="demo-heading"><h1>RFID attendance</h1><p>Scan your card and view your attendance history.</p></header><section class="demo-panel"><h2>Live clock</h2><div class="demo-clock"><span class="demo-badge">Philippine Standard Time · UTC+08:00</span><div><time id="demoClock"></time></div><p id="demoDate"></p></div></section><div class="demo-scanner"><h2>Tap your RFID card</h2><p>Use a USB reader or type any demo card number, then press Enter.</p><form id="scanForm" class="demo-form" style="margin:auto"><label>RFID card number<input autocomplete="off" placeholder="RFID-1001" aria-label="RFID card number"></label><button class="demo-button primary">Simulate scan</button></form><p id="scanStatus" role="status">Ready to scan · demonstration only</p></div><div class="demo-actions"><a class="demo-button" href="../employee/Employee_Attendance_History.html">View attendance history</a></div></main></div><script src="../assets/demo.js"></script></body></html>